VR
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/58101]Address Library for SKSEVR[/url]

Optional MCM addon
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/12604]SkyUI[/url] or [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/91535]SkyUI - VR[/url]
